        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "Job Opportunity | Production Executive 🚨\nNational Foods is hiring a Production Executive to join its production team and contribute to efficient manufacturing operations.\n📌 Position: Production Executive\n🎓 Qualification: Diploma / B.E. / B.Tech\n🔬 Relevant Fields: Food Technology, Production, Mechanical, Chemical or related field\n💼 Experience: 2–5 Years\n🏭 Industry Preference: FMCG / Food Manufacturing\n⏳ Joining: Immediate or within 7 days\n📍 Key Responsibilities:\n✅ Managing daily production activities and targets\n✅ Handling manpower and resource utilization\n✅ Ensuring quality, hygiene & food safety standards\n✅ Coordinating with QA/QC, Maintenance & Stores\n✅ Minimizing wastage, downtime & production losses\n✅ Ensuring compliance with SOPs, GMP, Safety & 5S\n📧 Apply by sending your CV to: hr@nationalfoods.co.in\n📝 Subject: Production Executive – Application\n⏰ Last Date to Apply: 08.09.2026",
          "posted_at": "2026-09-08T06:03:30.665Z"
        }
      }
    },
